/-!
# A374192

Number of iterations required to reach 1 or 10 in a modified Collatz trajectory where x -> x/2 if x is even, x -> x+1 if x is odd and not divisible by 3 and x -> 3x+1 if x is odd and divisible by 3; or a(n) = -1 if 1 or 10 is never reached.

The 80 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

